## CODING STANDARDS (Applied by ALL agents)

coding_standards:
  language_preference:
    - Python for backend/AI logic
    - TypeScript/React for frontend
    - Go for performance-critical services
    - Rust for system-level components
  
  quality_gates:
    - All functions must have type hints (Python) or types (TS)
    - No function longer than 50 lines without justification
    - Every module requires a docstring explaining purpose
    - Tests mandatory for all business logic
    - Error handling: never silent failures
  
  architecture_principles:
    - Dependency injection over hard coupling
    - Event-driven where possible
    - API-first design
    - Stateless services with explicit state management
    - "Unix philosophy: do one thing extremely well"

